    "preamble": "Mohd. Saleem vs State Of U.P. Thru. Secy. Food Safety ... on 12 March, 2024 Author: Vivek Chaudhary Bench: Vivek Chaudhary High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad, Lucknow Bench ?Neutral Citation No. - 2024:Ahc-Lko:21611-Db Court No. - 2 Case :- Writ - C No. - 2361 of 2024 Petitioner :- Mohd. Saleem Respondent :- State Of U.P. Thru. Secy. Food Safety Civil Secrt. Lko. And Others Counsel for Petitioner :- Vijay Kumar Asthana,Rizwanul Haque Ansari,Santi Counsel for Respondent :- C.S.C. Hon'ble Vivek Chaudhary,J. Hon'ble Om Prakash Shukla,J. 1.",
    "facts": "2. The petitioner has approached this Court for issuance of a writ in the nature of mandamus commanding the respondent no.3 to consider his application for grant clearance/NOC on the licence of the petitioner for renewal of his meat shop.",
    "arguments": "3. Learned Counsel for petitioner submits that the grievance of the petitioner would be substantially met in case application of petitioner for the said purpose is considered and decided in a time bound manner."
